# Phase 6 Walkthrough: Multi-Role System & Help Centre

I have successfully updated the React architecture to support distinct user personas and rebranded the settings page!

## 🔐 1. Multi-Role Navigation System
The web application now features a **Role Selector** gateway upon loading. This ensures that different types of users are routed directly to the tools they need.

The system natively supports:
- **Customer / Contributor (Beneficiary)**: Routes to the Wealth Dashboard, Financial Planning, and Help Centre.
- **Business Owner (Employer)**: Routes to a dedicated portal for uploading Employee Payroll CSVs and paying the monthly 4% contribution auto-debits.
- **Back Office Admin**: Routes to the internal system for Gov Employees to monitor distributed transactions, approve manual claims, and view error metrics.

