## 💬 2. Renamed to "Help Centre"
As requested, the complex "Omnichannel Settings" terminology has been simplified in the UI for end-users. It is now called the **Help Centre**, where customers can intuitively toggle their preferred support channels (WhatsApp, X, Email, etc.) without needing to understand the underlying infrastructure.

